  "known_gaps": [
    "Round004 is a static presentation-mesh proof: FBXs intentionally contain no armature, animation clips, runtime controller, Unity prefab, or playable deformation claim.",
    "Authored costume surfaces use procedural color, roughness, and bump response rather than a baked unique 4K costume atlas; the staged Rain anatomy textures are the only image texture payload.",
    "LOD1 (61951 triangles) and LOD2 (41158 triangles) are monotonic but exceed the aspirational 48-55k and 22-28k bands because face, hands, hair, and eye geometry were protected from aggressive generic collapse.",
    "Rigid armor and cloth presentation pieces were judged in neutral and one combat pose only; production extreme-pose collision, cloth simulation, and skin-weight cleanup remain outside this round.",
    "The supporting blade and back harness establish silhouette and two-hand contact, but are not a production scabbard, draw system, or weapon gameplay asset."
  ],
